				<r3d:description language="eng">CMO is a long-term project for the critical edition of Near Eastern music manuscripts. The project focusing on manuscripts of Ottoman music written in Hampartsum and staff notations during the nineteenth century, is funded by the German Research Foundation (DFG).
This platform provides access to the online versions of both music and text editions, as well as the source catalogue, which is a comprehensive database of printed, manuscript and online sources.</r3d:description>
